<title>JAPAN: S&amp;P assigns AA+ to Denmark's dual samurais.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P assigns AA+ to Denmark's dual samurais.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's Corp said on Friday it had assigned an AA+ rating to Denmark's 21 billion yen worth of 5.6 percent dual currency yen/Australian dollar samurai bonds due on February 3, 2000.</p>
</text>
